9-10T11:46:00.000Z","text":"Ola Electric Shares Jump 9%, Snap Three-Day Losing Run","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQY0cwTWZKSFlSekY2dGRpX1VtZ2RNenRzTVZnT0lrRHpWN3BKc2NqWnlxRmlYZThQUHVCME5ETFc0Z2syYnJzcGZPNUxBT1N4ckdtczUyN1lYWmFSUllYV1g5U0Nkc2lkbXRzc0g2bmNIODNuX3RNOUlNNmpoaXFoSV9VREU3Tm5SSFE?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-10T17:03:11.231Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-10T17:03:11.231Z"},{"id":"news-gn-ZVSl9HV2ZMY0EyZzU2ZzFjQ0JqYkJUQw","source":"news","author":"Livemint","handle":"Livemint","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-10T05:56:40.000Z","text":"Why Ola Electric and Ather Energy shares are rising today? Explained","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-10T06:18:15.146Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-10T17:03:11.231Z"},{"id":"news-gn-xraXNhWE5mWFVkYnZiNXR4dVJMazNCdw","source":"news","author":"economictimes.com","handle":"economictimes.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-10T05:13:27.000Z","text":"Ola Electric shares surge 7%. What’s triggering the sharp uptick in EV major?","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-10T06:18:15.146Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-10T17:03:11.231Z"},{"id":"news-gn-1hTFR1OFFRT2pTb0g5QnlTV3U3ZFRDVQ","source":"news","author":"Entrackr","handle":"Entrackr","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-03T07:15:29.000Z","text":"Ola Electric to consider another fundraise amid market share pressure","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-04T06:14:25.589Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-04T16:55:48.512Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650393","source":"valuepickr","author":"HSPl","handle":"@HSPl","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-09-01T03:38:58.065Z","text":"Ather had also marked Konarc. But the pricing is higher for a lower range. Does Ola have a genuinely better product? Is their cost of manufacturing or battery significantly lower compared to other players? Or is it due to their indigenous battery technology? A good ev scooter under 1 lakh would definitely click in market. Most good models are 1.25 lakhs.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/471","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-24T12:16:59.276Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650379","source":"valuepickr","author":"dinesh111a","handle":"@dinesh111a","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-08-31T17:14:15.502Z","text":"The main thing here to note is not the new launch… it is the delivery through first dealer operated store.. This is the first time they are going to deliver the product through physical store. i hope they will be able to do it timely.. A lot of thing may get change from here.. the service store also likely to operated through dealer only.. So major problem likely to get resolved with this… Bhavish Aggarwal @bhash First set of dealer stores going live on Janmashtami!","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/470","sentiment":"neutral","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-31T19:33:08.188Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-24T12:16:59.276Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650373","source":"valuepickr","author":"keshugarg","handle":"@keshugarg","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-08-31T16:41:46.764Z","text":"It’s intersting to see will ola manage to actually start deliveries as per given timeline or postpone it again. Also what will be the price at the time of deliveries as ola tend to increase the prices at the time of actual deliveries. And from financial results view how much operating margin will be impacted due to dealership model as currently ola has highest operating margin in the electric two wheeler industry.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/469","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-31T19:33:08.188Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-24T12:16:59.276Z"},{"id":"news-gn-TG14bnBocktkR1RORUxtdjR2eGloYk5j","source":"news","author":"Upstox","handle":"Upstox","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-08-31T09:16:41.000Z","text":"Ola Electric share price soars over 6%; shares cross 200 EMA and almost double from 52-week low; here is why","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-31T19:33:08.188Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-01T06:29:45.519Z"},{"id":"news-gn-WUW1jcWl0SWlzZ3RFM2ltQ2J5N3Njdmc","source":"news","author":"Moneycontrol.com","handle":"Moneycontrol.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-08-28T10:25:14.000Z","text":"Ola Electric shares gain 3% as new S1Z scooter brings in-house Bharat Cell to mass market","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-28T13:07:53.305Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-28T13:07:53.305Z"},{"id":"news-gn-2VEQ2MzAzdzBZTVQybmY5QmVvam9aaFE","source":"news","author":"The Economic Times","handle":"The Economic Times","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-08-28T09:02:05.000Z","text":"Ola Electric shares rally over 5%, rebound 79% from March low. Here’s what’s driving the stock","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-28T13:07:53.305Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-28T13:07:53.305Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650187","source":"valuepickr","author":"dinesh111a","handle":"@dinesh111a","community":"Ola Electric - Full Stack EV play?","timestamp":"2026-08-28T06:17:46.260Z","text":"Ola Electric launches S1Z scooter with Bharat Cell LFP, starting at ₹79,999 – deliveries from Dec 2026 S1Z scooter launched with Bharat Cell LFP technology 3.1 kWh variant: ₹ 79,999, range up to 179 kms (IDC) 5.1 kWh variant: ₹ 99,999, range up to 301 kms (IDC) Deliveries: 3.1 kWh from Dec 2026, 5.1 kWh from March 2027 The Ola S1Z will be the first product range to ramp up through Ola Electric’s next phase of retail expansion through its first dealer-operated stores, beyond a company-owned retail network. This is set to significantly expand access to Ola products across the country.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/ola-electric-full-stack-ev-play/158490/468","sentiment":"neutral","likes":2,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-28T13:07:53.305Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-24T12:16:59.276Z"}]}
